title: "One-Pedal Controller"

type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-13
authors:
  - family-names: "Nour Edeen"
    given-names: "Mohamad"
  - family-names: "Mokdad"
    given-names: "Mahdy"

repository-code: "https://github.com/mohamad-nouredeen/one-pedal-controller"

abstract: >
  Model-based design, simulation, functional-safety analysis, testing,
  embedded code generation, and Arduino/SimulIDE deployment of a
  one-pedal controller for an electric vehicle. The project includes
  Simulink and Stateflow controller models, a longitudinal vehicle plant,
  safety-related fault injection and testing, generated embedded C code,
  AVR firmware, and project documentation.

keywords:
  - one-pedal driving
  - electric vehicle
  - model-based design
  - MATLAB
  - Simulink
  - Stateflow
  - functional safety
  - ISO 26262
  - Arduino
  - embedded systems
  - vehicle dynamics

